        <p>4, ST. ANN'S SQUARE, MAN-CHESTER. GEO. DAVIES &amp; SON, CHARTERED PATENT AGENTS. ESTABLISHED DE 1835. SELF-HELP NEW TO PATENT LAW. COLONIAL FOREIGN PATENT LAW 4</p>
