      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1911-11-18_WidnesExaminer_art0087" n="art0087">
        <head>TO INDIA.</head>
        <p>TO INDIA.</p>
        <p>On Saturday last Cm King and Queen embarked on one of the most notable royal journeys ever made. It is the first time in the world's history that a British Sovereign has left his country to visit a part of his Empire. In London and Portsmouth thousands of people assembled to bid Godspeed"" to their King and Queen ; every point ef vantage was crowded with enthusiastic crowds. Their Majesties are due to arrive at Bombay on December 2nd. Our picture shows the "Medina " leaving the landing stage.</p>
