        <head>PALM GROVES AT TRIPOLI.</head>
        <p>THE PALM GROVES AT TRIPOLI.</p>
        <p>We reproduce above a view of the 04SiS at Tripoli. It was here that the Arabs attacked the Italians in the rear, on October 23rd, an action which resulted in scenes of retribution which have been the subject of discussion throughout the civilised world.</p>
